  "solution": "**Formula Used**\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² + b² - ab) \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n**(7.23 × 7.23 × 7.23 + 2.77 × 2.77 × 2.77)/(7.23 × 7.23 - 7.23 × 2.77 + 2.77 × 2.77)**\n\n⇒ ((7.23)³ + (2.77)³)/((7.23)² - 7.23 × 2.77 + (2.77)²)\n\n⇒ (7.23 + 2.77)(7.23² + 2.77² - 7.23 × 2.77)/(7.232 + 2.772 - 7.23 × 2.77)\n\n⇒ (7.23 + 2.77)\n\n⇒ 10\n\n**Hence, The value of the above equations is 10**\n\nd1:Ta7",
